  Self-talk content refers to the thoughts, words, and phrases we use when communicating with ourselves. Here are some examples of positive and negative self-talk content:

Positive Self-Talk Content
1. *Encouragement*: "I can do this!", "I'm capable and competent!", "I'm strong and resilient!"
2. *Affirmations*: "I am worthy of love and respect!", "I am beautiful inside and out!", "I am deserving of happiness and success!"
3. *Support*: "It's okay to make mistakes!", "I'm doing the best I can!", "I'm proud of myself for trying!"
4. *Motivation*: "I've got this!", "I'm almost there!", "I can push through this challenge!"
5. *Self-care*: "I need to take care of myself!", "I deserve to relax and unwind!" 
